Resources/MeCab/ipadic/*
# matrix.bin IS committed (see the exception below) — it's the only piece of MeCab's data the
# default trie segmenter's Viterbi scorer needs (IPADicMatrix.swift), and small enough (3.5MB)
# to check in directly so a fresh clone's default configuration isn't silently degraded. The
# rest of ipadic (sys.dic/unk.dic/char.bin, ~49.5MB) is only needed for the opt-in .mecab
# backend — see Resources/data_manifest.json for download instructions.
!Resources/MeCab/ipadic/matrix.bin
# UniDic (196MB) moved to Resources/MeCab-unidic-optional/ so it's never bundled into the app —
# see Resources/data_manifest.json. Not shipped by default: the .mecab backend's default
# dictionary is ipadic, and UniDic requires two separate manual Settings changes to reach.
Resources/MeCab-unidic-optional/
